  queries: {
    query: string; // The question to ask about the timeline
    chapters?: number[]; // Specific chapter numbers to query
    startChapter?: number; // Start of chapter range
    endChapter?: number; // End of chapter range
  }[]; // Queries to run against chapter summaries
}

Output ONLY the JSON object, no other text or markdown.

